OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUK working to identify exposure after
OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government says it is working to
OL,7,Fidentify any potential exposure in its
OL,8,Fonline services, after critical
OL,9,Fcyber-security flaws were identified in
OL,10,Fthe PHP programming language that
OL,11,Funderpins a significant number of the
OL,12,Fworld's websites.
OL,14,FGovernments and some of the world's
OL,15,Fbiggest companies are rushing to
OL,16,Fprotect systems that use PHP before
OL,17,Fhackers can exploit the flaws.
OL,19,FThe flaws were first discovered by AI,
OL,20,Fafter which governments urged anyone
OL,21,Fwho uses PHP to address them.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
