OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK government spokesperson urged "all
OL,7,Forganisations, private and public,
OL,8,Flarge and small" to follow guidance to
OL,9,Fprotect their systems.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
