OL,3,ARussell Brand accuser said alleged rape
OL,4,A'really hurt', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the woman had told her she had
OL,7,Fvisited Brand's house in London soon
OL,8,Fafter meeting at the theatre.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
